+Set `captureTab` on a focused element that uses Tab itself, such as a terminal
+or editor. Its `onKeyDown` still receives Tab and Shift+Tab, but the focus
+navigation actions stop there instead of moving to another control:
+
+```tsx
+<div tabIndex={0} captureTab onKeyDown={(event) => terminal.write(event)} />
+```
+
